+/**************************************************************************//**
+ @Function	fm_mac_set_max_frame_length
+
+ @Description   Change the maximum Rx frame length of an initialized MAC.
+
+ @Param[in]     fm_mac_dev   - A handle of the FM MAC device.
+ @Param[in]     len          - Whole frame, FCS included; at most
+                               fm_get_max_frm().
+
